This updates your route handler to current Vercel AI SDK (ai v6/v7) conventions—using inputSchema (instead of parameters), convertToModelMessages, toUIMessageStreamResponse()[1][2], stopWhen: isStepCount(8) (or stepCountIs in v6)[3][4], and native tool approval (needsApproval / toolApproval) for Human-in-the-Loop governance[5][6][7]—while dynamically assembling Sandbox, Search, Browser, and Computer tools from the active blueprint:
